Section: 3 Evaluation
Text: Our pattern learner, however, was restricted to learning linguistic expressions in speciﬁc syntactic construc- tions, usually requiring more than one word, because our goal was to study speciﬁc expressions associated with FACTUAL and FEELING argument styles. Ta- ble 1 shows that the lexico-syntactic patterns did ob- tain higher precision than the NB classiﬁer, but with lower recall.

